1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,500
The ride begins high in the mountains, cool and open beneath a long alpine ridge.

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:11,000
The trail bends downhill into the forest, where pines close in around the rider.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:17,500
Farther down, rock replaces the trees and the route crosses open canyon country.

4
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:24,000
At the end, the whole journey comes together in one trail map and one memory.
